1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,770
Tengah drive balik kerja...

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,252
tiba-tiba dada ketat,

3
00:00:03,262 --> 00:00:05,814
jantung laju, rasa macam nak mati.

4
00:00:05,824 --> 00:00:07,952
Pernah alami? Kajian anggarkan,

5
00:00:08,262 --> 00:00:10,456
lebih kurang satu dalam lapan

6
00:00:10,466 --> 00:00:13,038
orang pernah kena serangan panik.

7
00:00:13,136 --> 00:00:14,637
Bayangkan alarm kereta.

8
00:00:14,724 --> 00:00:16,698
Tujuannya, lindungi kereta.

9
00:00:16,812 --> 00:00:17,860
Tapi kadang-kadang...

10
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,559
kucing lompat atas bonet pun,

11
00:00:19,569 --> 00:00:20,863
alarm dah menjerit.

12
00:00:21,053 --> 00:00:22,415
Serangan panik macam tu.

13
00:00:22,493 --> 00:00:24,117
Otak tekan butang "lawan atau

14
00:00:24,127 --> 00:00:25,666
lari". Adrenalin naik,

15
00:00:25,676 --> 00:00:27,502
jantung laju, nafas cepat.

16
00:00:27,859 --> 00:00:29,897
Padahal, tak ada bahaya pun.

17
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,836
Ia memuncak dalam beberapa minit,

18
00:00:31,854 --> 00:00:33,442
dan kebanyakannya reda dalam dua

19
00:00:33,452 --> 00:00:34,221
puluh minit.

20
00:00:34,326 --> 00:00:36,107
Kalau ia berulang tanpa amaran,

21
00:00:36,117 --> 00:00:37,476
dan anda asyik risau ia

22
00:00:37,486 --> 00:00:38,136
datang lagi,

23
00:00:38,146 --> 00:00:39,786
sampai elak tempat tertentu,

24
00:00:39,854 --> 00:00:41,696
itu mungkin gangguan panik.

25
00:00:41,729 --> 00:00:43,244
Hanya doktor boleh sahkan.

26
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:44,054
Tapi ingat,

27
00:00:44,154 --> 00:00:46,073
sakit dada JANGAN terus anggap

28
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:48,259
panik. Kali pertama, sakit teruk,

29
00:00:48,281 --> 00:00:49,576
atau menjalar ke lengan,

30
00:00:49,586 --> 00:00:50,745
leher atau rahang?

31
00:00:50,781 --> 00:00:52,932
Segera hubungi 999.

32
00:00:52,998 --> 00:00:54,372
Kalau doktor dah sahkan ia

33
00:00:54,382 --> 00:00:55,920
panik, masa serangan,

34
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:57,107
tarik nafas perlahan,

35
00:00:57,117 --> 00:00:58,337
dan ingatkan diri:

36
00:00:58,386 --> 00:00:59,829
ini akan berlalu.

37
00:00:59,898 --> 00:01:01,996
Berita baiknya, ia boleh dirawat.

38
00:01:02,006 --> 00:01:03,747
Terapi CBT dan ubat yang

39
00:01:03,757 --> 00:01:05,286
sesuai terbukti membantu.

40
00:01:05,351 --> 00:01:06,648
Ini bukan mengada-ada,

41
00:01:06,658 --> 00:01:08,236
dan bukan tanda anda lemah.

42
00:01:08,266 --> 00:01:10,318
Alarm anda cuma terlalu sensitif...

43
00:01:10,328 --> 00:01:11,780
dan dengan bantuan yang betul,

44
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:13,230
ramai yang bertambah baik.

45
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,898
Save dan share video ni.

46
00:01:14,936 --> 00:01:17,332
Saya Dr. Azren. Spread positivity!
